Cell["\<\
We have checked the equivalence between Archive and Matchete results in the \
above non-zero cases under the permutation symmetry among (ff1,ff2) and \
(ff3,ff4) and tree-level Fierz identities. The differences above reveal \
different evanescent scenarios but do NOT affect the tree-level physical \
consequences.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001971856533023*^9, 
  4.0019720838524847`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3df52722-8d9a-4cd9-9eeb-\
172ae714331a"]
}, Open  ]],

